ssential","advertising":"marketing"}},"comp-jhxnwf3r":{"html":"<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:normal; font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">I have a fantastic new kitchen tool that I just love and I want to share it with you. My husband recently bought me a vegetable sheet cutter attachment for my Kitchenaid Stand Mixer and it&#39;s so much fun! </span></span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">You can still make this dish if you don&#39;t have a sheet cutter by thinly slicing the parsnips and potatoes as you would for making a gratin or scalloped potatoes and it will be really tasty, but the sheet slicer makes the dish feel more like a lasagna with large sheets of parsnips and potatoes standing in for the noodles.</span></span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The creamy mushroom sauce is spot on. I would eat this sauce on just about anything! It&#39;s that good.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">I hav</span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">e used store bought cremini in this recipe but Chanterelles, Fried Chicken mushrooms (</span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Lyophyllum decastes)</span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">, Honey Mushrooms (Armillaria),</span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;a variety of milk caps ( L</span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">actari</span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">us), Oyster mushrooms or Shrimp Russula (</span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Russula xerampelina)</span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"> mushrooms would be very tasty in this dish.</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(236, 77, 77); font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif; letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Important Note *</span></span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"> If using wild mushrooms for this recipe, b</span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">e sure you have properly identified the mushrooms and thoroughly cleaned and cooked them before adding them to this casserole.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">I like to use wild mushrooms that I have already prepared, </span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">saut&eacute;ed</span><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;and frozen, thaw just enough to loosen them and mix them in. If you have fresh wild mushrooms be sure to saute&#39; them thoroughly before adding them to the sauce.</span></h5>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jhxnwfb1":{"crop":{"x":5,"y":0,"width":4021,"height":3024},"alt":"Parsnip Potato Bake with Creamy Mushroom Sauce and Chicken","width":4032,"height":3024,"uri":"577c92_5da31b272d424e90b68a6fde6bdd64bb~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg","containerId":"comp-jhxnwfb1","hasBgScrollEffect":"","bgEffectName":"","displayMode":"fill","link":{},"encoding":"AVIF","allowWebpAvifTransforms":true,"responsiveImageProps":{"fallbackSrc":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_5da31b272d424e90b68a6fde6bdd64bb~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/crop/x_5,y_0,w_4021,h_3024/fill/w_504,h_379,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/577c92_5da31b272d424e90b68a6fde6bdd64bb~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg","srcset":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_5da31b272d424e90b68a6fde6bdd64bb~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/crop/x_5,y_0,w_4021,h_3024/fill/w_504,h_379,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/577c92_5da31b272d424e90b68a6fde6bdd64bb~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_5da31b272d424e90b68a6fde6bdd64bb~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/crop/x_5,y_0,w_4021,h_3024/fill/w_1008,h_758,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/577c92_5da31b272d424e90b68a6fde6bdd64bb~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg 2x","css":{"container":{"position":"relative"},"img":{"width":504,"height":379,"objectFit":"cover"}}},"containerWidth":504,"containerHeight":379,"isInFirstFold":false,"onClickBehavior":"disabled","fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WPhoto","language":"en","compId":"comp-jhxnwfb1","mainPageId":"qgy49","trackClicksAnalytics":false,"popupA11yExperimentEnabled":false,"translations":{"expandAriaLabel":"Expand image","zoomInButtonAriaLabel":"Zoom in"},"zoomedImageResp