nd&nbsp;you may want to save it to&nbsp;use soon in another recipe to avoid wasting perfectly good food.&nbsp;</span></h5>\n\n<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></h5>\n\n<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">One great way to use the cores from this dish is to chop up the parsnip&nbsp;and potato cores for hash browns. We dice them and put them immediately into the freezer in a baggy for the coming weekend. Superman always makes me breakfast on Sunday complete with diced hash browns and biscuits.&nbsp;We call it Biscuit Day and the dogs and I <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">love</span> biscuit day!</span></h5>\n\n<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></h5>\n\n<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></h5>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jhxnwfdj":{"translations":{"title":"Widget Didn’t Load","text1":"Check your internet and refresh this page.","text2":"If that doesn’t work, contact us."}},"comp-jhxnwfe4":{"translations":{"title":"Widget Didn’t Load","text1":"Check your internet and refresh this page.","text2":"If that doesn’t work, contact us."}},"comp-jhxnwfex":{"html":"<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This is one of the first things I made with my new vegetable sheet cutter and I will definitely be making it again and again. I love the texture of the potatoes and parsnips cut with the sheet cutter. It&#39;s a comforting and filling casserole without being too rich and the mushroom sauce is amazing!&nbsp;</span></h5>\n\n<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></h5>\n\n<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></h5>\n\n<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Cheers!</span></h5>\n\n<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">~Melisa</span></h5>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jhxnwffu":{"translations":{"title":"Widget Didn’t Load","text1":"Check your internet and refresh this page.","text2":"If that doesn’t work, contact us."}},"comp-jhxnwfgg":{},"comp-jhxnwfh7":{"html":"<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:35px;\"><span style=\"font-family:caudex,serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:35px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Parsnip Potato Bake with Creamy Mushroom Sauce and Chicken</span></span></h1>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jhxnwfi1":{"html":"<p 